#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:1
msgid "Jing'an"
msgstr "静安区"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:4
msgid "Enterprise AI, data services and digital commerce"
msgstr "企业人工智能、数据服务与数字商业"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:6
msgid ""
"The 2026-2028 AI application demonstration plan focuses on industry "
"integration and talent. Its stated objectives must be distinguished from "
"implementing rules and currently accepting applications."
msgstr "2026至2028年人工智能创新应用示范区方案聚焦产业融合与人才。规划目标应与实施细则及正在受理的申报事项区分。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S067 "
"<https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-03-27/1b9b0944-356c-4561-b157-502a9e1af84d.html>`_. "
"静安区发展和改革委员会、静安区科技和经济委员会关于印发《静安区打造人工智能创新应用示范区三年行动方案（2026—2028年）》的通知."
msgstr "`证据 S067 <https://www.jingan.gov.cn/govxxgk/JA2/2026-03-27/1b9b0944-356c-4561-b157-502a9e1af84d.html>`_. 静安区发展和改革委员会、静安区科技和经济委员会关于印发《静安区打造人工智能创新应用示范区三年行动方案（2026—2028年）》的通知."

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:10
msgid "Who receives the inquiry"
msgstr "咨询受理"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:13
msgid "Jing'an science and economy authority"
msgstr "静安区科技和经济委员会"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:15
msgid "`Official district website <https://www.jingan.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`区政府官网 <https://www.jingan.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:17
msgid ""
"A current direct program phone or email is not established in this "
"record. Use the official website to request the named receiving team."
msgstr "本记录未核实现行项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官网索取具体受理团队。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:19
msgid "Before applying"
msgstr "申请之前"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:22
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:24
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:26
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:28
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:30
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:32
msgid ""
"Ask which current notice governs the project, whether registration and "
"actual operations must both be in the district, which expenditure period "
"is eligible, and whether previous municipal or district awards exclude a "
"claim. Obtain the answer before moving a company or incurring costs."
msgstr "询问适用的现行通知、注册与经营是否均须属地、可计入支出期间，以及已获市区资助是否影响申报。应在迁移企业或发生费用之前获得答复。"

#: ../../districts/jingan.rst:34
msgid "Local organizations in this atlas"
msgstr "本图谱中的本区机构"

